---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import VentureCard from '../components/VentureCard.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hobbies — Rohit Malhotra" currentPage="hobbies">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-white dark:bg-dark min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <SectionHeading title="Hobbies" />

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <VentureCard
          title="Guitar"
          role=""
          image="/img/guitar.jpg"
          description="Classical and rock guitar."
        >
          I started playing classical music on a nylon string guitar in the 3rd
          grade. My preferred play style now is classic rock. My biggest
          inspirations are David Gilmour (Pink Floyd), Chad Smith (RHCP), Eric
          Clapton, Christine McVie (Fleetwood Mac), and more.
        </VentureCard>

        <VentureCard
          title="Climbing"
          role=""
          image="/img/climb.png"
          description="Indoor and outdoor climbing."
        >
          I climb both indoors and outdoors. As of recently, I have been working
          on my bouldering strength, but I enjoy rope climbing as well. I'm
          inspired by the smooth style and perseverance of Tommy Caldwell, Dave
          Macleod, and Lonnie Kosuko Kauk.
        </VentureCard>

        <VentureCard
          title="Long Distance Running / Road Biking"
          role=""
          image="/img/bike.png"
          description="Trail running and road biking."
        >
          I ran cross country competitively in high school. A lot of my training
          was done in the hills, and ever since I have enjoyed exploring new
          trails and roads in the mountains. This picture is of San Felipe hills
          in San Jose, California.
        </VentureCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
